From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: BouBou <69978359+BouBouw@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sat, 14 Nov 2026 12:00:00 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] rustic: pack, mod and Create World helpers, mod tags, pad clicks to hooks

Client helpers for a mod that draws the options' pack screen, the mod browser and
Create World its own way: options_page(), options_packs(), options_mods(),
options_act(act) (pack arrows, restore, folders, leave, install, switch, page),
create_world() and create_world_act(act) (name, seed, any tab's button by id
through Title::press_create), and pad_clicks_to_hooks(on), which lets the clicks
a controller or the keyboard's focus makes up reach the screens' mouse hooks
(press_at's never do). PackScreen::act/restore/can; the settings shell's rows
get tags and two-line notes; options_shell::set_mod_tags and set_find_mods.
Off by default: nothing changes with no mod. Rustic ADR 0015, U19.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
